// STT-MRAM bitcell, Part C.
// The 16 lines specified in the assignment, plus the four NVSim requires and the
// assignment omits (MinSenseVoltage, ReadVoltage, ResetEnergy/SetEnergy), taken
// from NVSim's shipped sample_STTRAM.cell so the periphery matches Part A's
// 25 mV sense-amp offset.

-MemCellType: MRAM
-CellArea (F^2): 54
-CellAspectRatio: 2.0
-ResistanceOn (ohm): 3000
-ResistanceOff (ohm): 6000
-ReadMode: current
-ReadCurrent (uA): 40
-ReadPower (uW): 145
-ResetMode: current
-ResetCurrent (uA): 200
-ResetPulse (ns): 10
-SetMode: current
-SetCurrent (uA): 200
-SetPulse (ns): 10
-AccessType: CMOS
-AccessCMOSWidth (F): 6

-ReadVoltage (V): 0.25
-MinSenseVoltage (mV): 25
-ResetEnergy (pJ): 1
-SetEnergy (pJ): 1
-VoltageDropAccessDevice (V): 0.15
